    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JRPG With TRPG Elements</h2></strong><br>Inspired by GameBook, each scene is presented as a hand-drawn map.<br>A simple TRPG skill check mechanic adds an extra layer of fun and challenge to the adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/c80fd26c0788d56f196a4926952ad76c.poster.avif?t=1747655922\" width=580 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/c80fd26c0788d56f196a4926952ad76c.webm?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/c80fd26c0788d56f196a4926952ad76c.mp4?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Themed Levels</h2></strong><br>You can travel through magical forests to freezing mountain peaks. Explore a variety of landscapes and handle diverse challenges.<br>Gather clues, use your wits to solve puzzles, and make the right choice to conquer the trials ahead.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/de123681602441351ed80baed3fa8ce5.poster.avif?t=1747655922\" width=580 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/de123681602441351ed80baed3fa8ce5.webm?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/de123681602441351ed80baed3fa8ce5.mp4?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Turn-Based Combat</h2></strong><br>Battle against dozens of monsters, each with their own unique qualities, delivering an exciting combat experience.<br>The combination of allies, skills, and weapons \u2014 as well as careful observation of monster behavior \u2014 is the key to victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/40b5d462039992c9a963202f9cfad7ea.poster.avif?t=1747655922\" width=580 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/40b5d462039992c9a963202f9cfad7ea.webm?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/40b5d462039992c9a963202f9cfad7ea.mp4?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Companions to Enrich Your Journey</h2></strong><br>Meet and recruit a diverse cast of companions, each with their own abilities and personalities.<br>They'll support you on your adventure. As you grow closer, you can uncover their hidden pasts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/3ffcc19cca2df0762f5a122ee5092f70.poster.avif?t=1747655922\" width=580 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/3ffcc19cca2df0762f5a122ee5092f70.webm?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/3ffcc19cca2df0762f5a122ee5092f70.mp4?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability in New Game+</h2></strong><br>The protagonist has four distinct origins to choose from, offering different perspectives and experiences to piece together the full story.<br>Some content can only be unlocked in New Game+, with plenty of hidden details and Easter eggs waiting to be discovered.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's New in the Remastered Edition</h2></strong><br>- New levels with added interactive content and branching events, while maintaining the core storyline.<br>- A new ability system with more options for combos and strategies.<br>- Improved accessibility and gameplay from the original game, with new features like auto-save, an encyclopedia, and achievements.<br>- Expanded lore and more interactions with companions.<br>- A fully upgraded UI.<br>- Enhanced level and battle cutscenes.<br>- The original art has been remastered in HD, and new visuals have been added for a more immersive experience.<br>- Multi-language support and full controller compatibility.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JRPG With TRPG Elements</h2></strong><br>Inspired by GameBook, each scene is presented as a hand-drawn map.<br>A simple TRPG skill check mechanic adds an extra layer of fun and challenge to the adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/c80fd26c0788d56f196a4926952ad76c.poster.avif?t=1747655922\" width=580 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/c80fd26c0788d56f196a4926952ad76c.webm?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/c80fd26c0788d56f196a4926952ad76c.mp4?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Themed Levels</h2></strong><br>You can travel through magical forests to freezing mountain peaks. Explore a variety of landscapes and handle diverse challenges.<br>Gather clues, use your wits to solve puzzles, and make the right choice to conquer the trials ahead.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/de123681602441351ed80baed3fa8ce5.poster.avif?t=1747655922\" width=580 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/de123681602441351ed80baed3fa8ce5.webm?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/de123681602441351ed80baed3fa8ce5.mp4?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Turn-Based Combat</h2></strong><br>Battle against dozens of monsters, each with their own unique qualities, delivering an exciting combat experience.<br>The combination of allies, skills, and weapons \u2014 as well as careful observation of monster behavior \u2014 is the key to victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/40b5d462039992c9a963202f9cfad7ea.poster.avif?t=1747655922\" width=580 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/40b5d462039992c9a963202f9cfad7ea.webm?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/40b5d462039992c9a963202f9cfad7ea.mp4?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Companions to Enrich Your Journey</h2></strong><br>Meet and recruit a diverse cast of companions, each with their own abilities and personalities.<br>They'll support you on your adventure. As you grow closer, you can uncover their hidden pasts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/3ffcc19cca2df0762f5a122ee5092f70.poster.avif?t=1747655922\" width=580 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/3ffcc19cca2df0762f5a122ee5092f70.webm?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185060/extras/3ffcc19cca2df0762f5a122ee5092f70.mp4?t=1747655922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability in New Game+</h2></strong><br>The protagonist has four distinct origins to choose from, offering different perspectives and experiences to piece together the full story.<br>Some content can only be unlocked in New Game+, with plenty of hidden details and Easter eggs waiting to be discovered.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's New in the Remastered Edition</h2></strong><br>- New levels with added interactive content and branching events, while maintaining the core storyline.<br>- A new ability system with more options for combos and strategies.<br>- Improved accessibility and gameplay from the original game, with new features like auto-save, an encyclopedia, and achievements.<br>- Expanded lore and more interactions with companions.<br>- A fully upgraded UI.<br>- Enhanced level and battle cutscenes.<br>- The original art has been remastered in HD, and new visuals have been added for a more immersive experience.<br>- Multi-language support and full controller compatibility.",
    "short_description": "In a quiet corner of a small town by the river, ancient ruins have mysteriously reappeared. Within lies a sprawling labyrinth filled with cryptic prophecies that have drawn in adventurers from far and wide. But alongside the legendary monsters and treasures, many more secrets remain hidden...",
